  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThis beautifully renovated villa is designed with versatility in mind. Currently this light-filled, sophisticated home offers two bedrooms and two living rooms. If you require 3 bedrooms, you can easily build a wall and door in the open plan second lounge. The home offers effortless living with beautifully planted gardens. Perfect for small families, downsizers and any buyer who does not want to compromise on style and quality! \r\n\r\nFully and beautifully renovated while lovingly retaining its original character, this light-filled home features polished native timber floors, high ceilings, fireplaces, and elegant period detailing throughout.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautiful light-filled designer kitchen with views, flowing seamlessly into the open-plan family and dining areas. Double-glazed doors open to a sun-filled, northeast-facing deck with stunning sunrises and views of Mt Victoria — the perfect spot for morning coffee and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nOutside is a true gardener's delight. The wonderful established gardens enjoy absolute all-day sun and feature raised veggie patches, a prolific assortment of established fruit trees, beautiful flower beds, and a handy gardener's shed — a private and productive oasis. There is also plenty of space for a swimming pool, plus room for a garage to the side for extra storage. The attractive, well-designed front garden provides off-street parking for two vehicles.\r\n\r\nWe highly encourage you to view this fabulous, sophisticated, classic and sunny home. Perfectly positioned within easy walking distance to the village, ferry, beaches, and top schools in a friendly, safe neighbourhood — what more could you ask for!",
